## Project Documentation Phase
 The documentation phase records all details of the **EduGenie** project for future reference and evaluation.
 - **Project Overview:** Document the purpose, scope, and objectives.
- **Requirement Documentation:** Record functional and non-functional requirements.
- **System Design:** Document system architecture, modules, workflow, and database design.
- **Technology Documentation:** Describe Python, Streamlit, Google Gemini API, and other technologies used.
- **Implementation Details:** Explain the development and integration of each module.
- **Testing Documentation:** Record test cases, results, errors, and fixes.
- **User Guide:** Provide instructions for using EduGenie.
- **Screenshots:** Include important application screens and outputs.
- **Results:** Document the final system performance and outcomes.
- **Future Enhancements:** Mention possible improvements and additional features.
- **Final Report:** Compile all project details into a complete project report.
